<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - MAPCO downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - MAPCO downgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it lowered its near-term  rating on MAPCO Inc to neutral from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Kept long-term buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares closed Thursday at 30-15/16.</p>
</text>
